# Project Images

This directory contains the images used to document the **ECG Heartbeat Monitoring System**.

## Contents

| File | Description |
|---|---|
| `ecg-circuit-diagram.png` | Circuit diagram showing the Arduino UNO and AD8232 ECG sensor connections. |
| `ecg-hardware-setup.jpeg` | Photograph of the assembled ECG hardware prototype. |
| `ECG_Waveform.png` | Example ECG waveform captured and visualized by the project. |
| `IMG-20250219-WA0012.jpg` | Additional photograph from the project setup. |

## Usage

These images are referenced by the main repository `README.md` to document the **circuit, hardware setup, and ECG waveform output**.

> **Note:** The repository also contains a copy of `ecg-circuit-diagram.png` in the project root. The image in this directory is the version used for the image documentation section.
